---
description: Call the installed 3ds Max 2022 executable
alwaysApply: true
---

3ds Max on this machine is `D:\SoftData\3DMax\3ds Max 2022\3dsmax.exe`. When the user says 3dmax, 3ds Max, or 3xmax, call this executable. Do not call `3dsmaxbatch.exe`, and do not search for another install.

Launch the GUI executable with the MaxScript switch:

```
& "D:\SoftData\3DMax\3ds Max 2022\3dsmax.exe" -U MAXScript d:\Custom\TD\tools\max\<script>.ms
```

MaxScript files must be ASCII without a UTF-8 BOM. The script should `quitMax quiet:true` after it writes its result, so the process does not stay open.
